@startuml
title Sequence - UC-06 Phân tích & thiết lập điểm đón tự động
actor "Admin Dashboard" as AdminUI
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Analytics Service" as Analytics
participant "Spark Batch Jobs" as Spark
participant "Kafka" as Kafka
database "DB" as DB

AdminUI -> API : POST /analysis/pickup-points/run
API -> Auth : validate admin token
Auth --> API : OK
API -> Analytics : trigger job request
Analytics -> Kafka : publish job command

Spark -> Kafka : consume job command
Spark -> DB : read enrollments & geo data
DB --> Spark : data
Spark -> DB : write proposed pickup points
Spark -> Kafka : publish job result

Kafka -> Analytics : notify result
Analytics -> API : job completed
API --> AdminUI : show proposals
@enduml